## 1. Core GitOps Mental Models & Argo CD Principles

```
                         THE 7 GOLDEN RULES OF GITOPS
 ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ 1. Git is the ONLY Source of Truth (Single Source of Truth)                 │
 │    • If a resource is not defined in Git, it does not exist.                │
 │    • Direct `kubectl apply / edit / delete` in production is forbidden.     │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 2. Pull-Based Controller vs. Push-Based CI/CD                               │
 │    • CI builds container images and pushes manifests to Git.                │
 │    • Argo CD (in-cluster agent) pulls from Git and reconciles state.        │
 │    • Eliminates the need to give external CI systems cluster admin keys.    │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 3. Continuous Drift Detection & Automated Self-Healing                      │
 │    • OutOfSync = Live cluster state differs from Git desired state.         │
 │    • Self-Healing instantly reverts manual ad-hoc cluster changes back to   │
 │      the exact state committed in Git.                                      │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 4. Sync Waves (-5 to +5) Guarantee Deterministic Deployment Order           │
 │    • Lower wave numbers sync first. Phase 1: Namespaces/CRDs (Wave -2) ──▶  │
 │      Phase 2: DB Migration Job (Wave -1) ──▶ Phase 3: App Pods (Wave 0).   │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 5. AppProjects Define Multi-Tenant Blast Radius Guardrails                  │
 │    • Limits what clusters, namespaces, and repositories a team can target.  │
 │    • Blacklists sensitive cluster-scoped objects (ClusterRoles, Webhooks).  │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 6. Secrets in Git Must Be Encrypted (Or Referenced via External Secrets)    │
 │    • Plaintext secrets in Git are an immediate catastrophic failure.        │
 │    • Use External Secrets Operator (ESO) with AWS Secrets Manager/Vault or  │
 │      client-side encryption via Mozilla SOPS / Bitnami Sealed Secrets.      │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 7. Argo CD Renders Helm & Kustomize; It Does NOT Run Helm Tiller/Engines    │
 │    • Argo CD runs `helm template` under the hood and manages the generated  │
 │      vanilla Kubernetes resources directly via the Kubernetes API.          │
 └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

