### Module 3: Application CRD Anatomy, Source & Destination Configs (Page 3)

```yaml
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: Application
metadata:
  name: payment-service
  namespace: argocd
  finalizers:
    # Cascading deletion: Deleting this Application deletes its K8s resources
    - resources-finalizer.argocd.argoproj.io
spec:
  project: payment-project           # Must match an existing AppProject
  
  # 1. SOURCE: Where manifests live in Git
  source:
    repoURL: 'https://github.com/enterprise/payment-app.git'
    targetRevision: main             # Git Branch, Tag, or Commit SHA
    path: overlays/production        # Directory containing kustomization.yaml / manifests
    
  # 2. DESTINATION: Target Cluster & Namespace
  destination:
    server: 'https://kubernetes.default.svc' # Local in-cluster (or external cluster API)
    namespace: payments

  # 3. SYNC POLICY
  syncPolicy:
    automated:
      prune: true                    # Auto-delete objects removed from Git
      selfHeal: true                 # Revert manual kubectl edits in the cluster
    syncOptions:
      - CreateNamespace=true         # Auto-create namespace if missing
      - ServerSideApply=true         # Use K8s Server-Side Apply for large CRDs
```

