### Module 4: Continuous Reconciliation, Sync Operations & Application State (Page 4)

```
                            APPLICATION STATE MATRIX
 ┌──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ Sync Status          │ Meaning                                              │
 ├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 🟢 Synced            │ Desired state in Git EXACTLY matches live cluster.   │
 │ 🟠 OutOfSync         │ Differences detected (New Git commit or manual edit).│
 │ ❓ Unknown           │ Cannot reach cluster API or Git repo to check state. │
 ├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ Health Status        │ Meaning                                              │
 ├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 💚 Healthy           │ All Pods running, probes passing, PVCs bound.        │
 │ 🔄 Progressing       │ Rolling update in progress, waiting for pods ready.  │
 │ 💔 Degraded          │ Pods crashing, CrashLoopBackOff, PVC mount failed.   │
 │ ⚪ Missing           │ Declared resource has not yet been created in cluster│
 └──────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

### Module 5: Automated Sync Policies, Pruning, Self-Healing & Server-Side Apply (Page 5)

```yaml
syncPolicy:
  automated:
    prune: true                      # Deletes live resources if removed from Git
    selfHeal: true                   # Re-applies Git state if manual cluster edit occurs
    allowEmpty: false                # Prevents deleting entire cluster if directory is empty
  syncOptions:
    - CreateNamespace=true
    - PruneLast=true                 # Delete old resources ONLY after new ones are healthy
    - PrunePropagationPolicy=foreground
    - ApplyOutOfSyncOnly=true        # Optimizes performance by syncing changed items only
    - ServerSideApply=true           # Manages field-level ownership natively in API server
    - RespectIgnoreDifferences=true  # Ignores live changes (e.g. HPA replica counts)
```
> [!CAUTION]
> **Blind Pruning Warning:** If a developer accidentally deletes a manifest file in Git, `prune: true` will **instantly delete the production workload**. Protect production branches with mandatory PR reviews and branch protection rules!

