### Module 6: Sync Waves, Pre/Post Hooks & Deterministic Deployment Ordering (Page 6)

```
                       ARGO CD SYNC WAVE EXECUTION FLOW
 ┌───────────────────┐     ┌───────────────────┐     ┌───────────────────┐
 │ Wave -2           │────▶│ Wave -1           │────▶│ Wave 0 (Default)  │
 │ Namespaces, CRDs, │     │ PreSync DB        │     │ Deployments,      │
 │ Secret Stores     │     │ Migration Job     │     │ Services, Ingress │
 └───────────────────┘     └───────────────────┘     └───────────────────┘
                                                               │
                                                               ▼
                                                     ┌───────────────────┐
                                                     │ Wave +1 (PostSync)│
                                                     │ Smoke Test Job,   │
                                                     │ Slack Notify Hook │
                                                     └───────────────────┘
```

#### 🛠️ PreSync Database Migration Job Example
```yaml
apiVersion: batch/v1
kind: Job
metadata:
  name: schema-migration-v2
  annotations:
    argocd.argoproj.io/hook: PreSync
    argocd.argoproj.io/hook-delete-policy: HookSucceeded
    argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: "-1"
spec:
  template:
    spec:
      restartPolicy: Never
      containers:
        - name: migrate
          image: myapp-migrate:v2.0
          command: ["./migrate-db.sh"]
```

