### Module 7: Repository Design & GitOps Environment Strategy (Monorepo vs. Polyrepo) (Page 7)

```
                   RECOMMENDED DIRECTORY-PER-ENVIRONMENT LAYOUT
 payment-gitops-repo/
 ├── base/                           (Common manifests across all environments)
 │   ├── deployment.yaml
 │   ├── service.yaml
 │   └── kustomization.yaml
 └── environments/
     ├── dev/                        (Dev environment overlay)
     │   ├── patches/
     │   └── kustomization.yaml
     ├── staging/                    (Staging overlay)
     │   ├── patches/
     │   └── kustomization.yaml
     └── production/                 (Production overlay: Locked down, restricted)
         ├── patches/
         │   ├── replica_count.yaml  (Replicas: 10)
         │   └── resource_limits.yaml
         └── kustomization.yaml
```

* **Why Directory-per-Environment Wins:** Avoids merge hell across branches. Promotion is done cleanly via Pull Requests updating image tags and Kustomize overlays.

