### Module 9: Kustomize Base & Overlays in Declarative Delivery (Page 9)

```yaml
# environments/production/kustomization.yaml
apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1
kind: Kustomization

resources:
  - ../../base

images:
  - name: myapp-backend
    newName: 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/myapp
    newTag: v2.4.1                   # Tag updated by CI automation on merge

patches:
  - path: patches/hpa-limits.yaml
```

