### Module 10: ApplicationSets for Fleet-Scale Multi-Cluster Deployments (Page 10)

```
                            APPLICATIONSET GENERATOR
 ┌───────────────────────────┐      Discovers Clusters      ┌──────────────────┐
 │ ApplicationSet Controller │─────────────────────────────▶│ Cluster Generator│
 │ (Template Engine)         │                              │ (env=production) │
 └───────────────────────────┘                              └────────┬─────────┘
               │                                                     │
               ▼ Generates Multiple Application CRDs                 ▼
 ┌───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────┐
 │ App: Payment (US-East)    │ App: Payment (EU-West)    │ App: Payment (APAC) │
 └───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴─────────────────────┘
```

#### 🛠️ Production Cluster Generator ApplicationSet
```yaml
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: ApplicationSet
metadata:
  name: cluster-addons
  namespace: argocd
spec:
  generators:
    - clusters:
        selector:
          matchLabels:
            tier: production         # Targets all clusters labeled tier=production
  template:
    metadata:
      name: '{{name}}-datadog-agent'
    spec:
      project: platform
      source:
        repoURL: 'https://helm.datadoghq.com'
        chart: datadog
        targetRevision: 3.45.0
      destination:
        server: '{{server}}'         # Injected cluster API endpoint
        namespace: datadog
      syncPolicy:
        automated:
          prune: true
          selfHeal: true
```

