### Module 11: AppProjects & Multi-Tenant Governance (Blast Radius Isolation) (Page 11)

```yaml
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: AppProject
metadata:
  name: payment-team-project
  namespace: argocd
spec:
  description: "Governance boundary for the Payments microservice team"
  
  # Whitelist allowable Git repositories
  sourceRepos:
    - 'https://github.com/enterprise/payment-*.git'
    
  # Whitelist allowable destination clusters & namespaces
  destinations:
    - namespace: 'payment-*'
      server: 'https://kubernetes.default.svc'
      
  # Blacklist cluster-scoped privileged resources
  clusterResourceBlacklist:
    - group: ''
      kind: Node
    - group: 'rbac.authorization.k8s.io'
      kind: ClusterRoleBinding
      
  # Whitelist namespace-scoped resources
  namespaceResourceWhitelist:
    - group: 'apps'
      kind: Deployment
    - group: ''
      kind: Service
    - group: ''
      kind: ConfigMap
```

