### Module 12: Authentication, OIDC/SSO (Dex, Okta, Azure AD) & Granular RBAC (Page 12)

```csv
# /etc/argo/argocd-rbac-cm.yaml (ConfigMap)
# Format: p, <role/subject>, <resource>, <action>, <project/app>, <permission>

# 1. Read-Only Developer Role
p, role:developer, applications, get, payment-team-project/*, allow
p, role:developer, applications, sync, payment-team-project/*, allow
p, role:developer, logs, get, payment-team-project/*, allow

# 2. DevOps Lead Role (Full control over project)
p, role:lead, applications, *, payment-team-project/*, allow

# 3. Map IdP (Okta / Azure AD) SSO Groups to Argo CD Roles
g, "Enterprise-DevOps-Admins", role:admin
g, "Payment-Engineers", role:developer
```

