### Module 13: Secrets Management in GitOps: ESO, Vault, Sealed Secrets & SOPS (Page 13)

```mermaid
graph LR
    Git[📄 Git Repo: ExternalSecret Manifest] --> Argo[🐙 Argo CD Sync]
    Argo --> K8s[☸️ Kubernetes Cluster]
    ESO[🔐 External Secrets Operator] -->|Polls Secret| AWS[(☁️ AWS Secrets Manager)]
    ESO -->|Injects Decrypted| RealSec[🔑 Native K8s Secret]
    RealSec -.->|Mounted by| Pod[📦 App Pod]
```

```yaml
# Declarative ExternalSecret (Committed safely to Git)
apiVersion: external-secrets.io/v1beta1
kind: ExternalSecret
metadata:
  name: database-credentials
  namespace: payments
spec:
  refreshInterval: 1h
  secretStoreRef:
    name: aws-secrets-manager
    kind: ClusterSecretStore
  target:
    name: db-secret                  # Name of K8s Secret to create
  data:
    - secretKey: DB_PASSWORD
      remoteRef:
        key: production/payments/db
        property: password
```

