### Module 15: Progressive Delivery with Argo Rollouts: Blue-Green & Canary Analysis (Page 15)

```yaml
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: Rollout
metadata:
  name: payment-rollout
spec:
  replicas: 10
  strategy:
    canary:
      analysis:
        templates:
          - templateName: success-rate-check
        args:
          - name: service-name
            value: payment-svc
      steps:
        - setWeight: 10              # Route 10% traffic to canary v2
        - pause: { duration: 10m }   # Monitor metrics for 10 minutes
        - setWeight: 50              # Route 50% traffic
        - pause: { duration: 15m }
        # Automatically scales to 100% if Prometheus analysis succeeds!
```

