### Module 17: Observability, Prometheus Metrics, Controller Sharding & Scaling (Page 17)

```
                         ARGO CD CONTROLLER SHARDING
 ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ Application Controller Shard 0 ──▶ Reconciles Cluster 1 & Cluster 2         │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ Application Controller Shard 1 ──▶ Reconciles Cluster 3 & Cluster 4         │
 ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ Application Controller Shard N ──▶ Reconciles Cluster 5 & Cluster 6         │
 └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

#### 📊 High-Yield Prometheus Metrics
* `argocd_app_reconcile_count`: Total reconciliation loops executed.
* `argocd_app_sync_total`: Rate of successful vs failed synchronizations.
* `argocd_git_request_duration_seconds`: Latency of Git repository clone and fetch operations.

