### Module 18: Production Troubleshooting Playbooks & Error Matrix (Page 18)

```
 ┌────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ #  │ Error / Status         │ Root Cause                       │ SRE Resolution Playbook                    │
 ├────┼────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │ 1  │ `ComparisonError`      │ Invalid YAML syntax or CRD missing│ Run `helm template` or `kustomize build`   │
 │ 2  │ `SharedResourceWarning`│ 2 Applications manage same object│ Assign clear resource ownership via Project│
 │ 3  │ `PermissionDenied`     │ Target cluster SA lacks K8s RBAC │ Update cluster role for `argocd-manager`   │
 │ 4  │ `Git Timeout / 128`    │ SSH key expired or GitHub down   │ Verify repo secret credentials & network   │
 │ 5  │ `Stuck Terminating`    │ K8s finalizers blocked on delete │ Inspect `metadata.finalizers` on App/Obj   │
 └────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

