### Module 19: Disaster Recovery, Backup (`argocd-util`), Upgrades & Reliability (Page 19)

```bash
# 1. Export Full Argo CD State (Applications, Projects, Settings, Secrets)
argocd-util export -n argocd > /backup/argocd-backup-$(date +%F).yaml

# 2. Disaster Recovery Restore
argocd-util import -n argocd < /backup/argocd-backup-2026-08-23.yaml

# 3. Force Hard Refresh on Git Cache
argocd app get <app-name> --hard-refresh
```

