### Module 20: Enterprise Architecture Blueprint & 20-Point Readiness Checklist (Page 20)

```
                    ENTERPRISE GITOPS PRODUCTION AUDIT
 ┌──┬─────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │  │ Verification Area           │ Production Standard                        │
 ├──┼─────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────┤
 │☐ │ Zero Direct Cluster Access  │ Developers do NOT hold `kubectl` prod keys │
 │☐ │ Secret Management           │ ESO / Vault active; zero secrets in Git    │
 │☐ │ Multi-Tenancy Guardrails    │ Every app bound to a scoped `AppProject`   │
 │☐ │ Automated Self-Healing      │ `selfHeal: true` active on production apps │
 │☐ │ Sync Wave Sequencing        │ PreSync DB migrations separated from Pods  │
 │☐ │ SSO & RBAC Integration      │ OIDC / Okta mapped to least-privilege roles│
 │☐ │ High Availability           │ Redis Sentinel + Multi-Replica Controllers │
 │☐ │ Controller Sharding         │ Sharding enabled for >100 clusters/1k apps │
 │☐ │ Progressive Delivery        │ Argo Rollouts canary active for criticals  │
 │☐ │ Disaster Recovery           │ Automated daily `argocd-util` exports to S3│
 └──┴─────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

